y Puzzle Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Full Version : https://www.oculus.com/experiences/quest/4058005747577896/\n\nFamiliar to play, yet challenging to master, Candy Puzzle brings fresh mind-bending challenges and unanticipated obstacles to the casual phenomenon loved by everyone! Keep your brain fit and boost your problem-solving skills by mastering the tricky levels based on real-life physics. Tired of mind game? Just sit/stand back and enjoy the cheerful and relaxing game atmosphere of one of the most beautiful game for everyone.\n\n=== Features ===\n- Easy to challenging levels\n- 50+ levels in full version\n- Amazing relaxing music and environment\n- 90Hz support\n\nNote: We will add more levels in future updates", "short_description": "Familiar to play, yet challenging to master, Candy Puzzle brings fresh mind-bending challenges and unanticipated obstacles to the casual phenomenon loved by everyone! Keep your brain fit and boost your problem-solving skills by mastering the tricky levels based on real-life physics. Tired of mind game? Just sit/stand back and enjoy the cheerful and relaxing game atmosphere of one of the most beautiful game for everyone."}]}, "developer_name": "Thunder Game Development Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://thundergamestudio.com/policy/metapolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Thunder Game Development Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://thundergamestudio.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "PUZZLE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages":